OL,3,ANI first minister asks protesters to
OL,4,Astay until midnight as Orange Order
OL,5,Avows to complete parade
OL,6,
OL,7,FA controversial parade organised by
OL,8,FNorthern Ireland's Orange Order is
OL,9,Fdelayed as hundreds of protesters block
OL,10,Fits route in Portadown
OL,12,FNI Secretary of State Sir Chris Bryant
OL,13,Fhas called for both sides to "double
OL,14,Fdown on compromise" - he has returned
OL,15,Ffrom the Labour Party conference to
OL,16,Fhave meetings with local leaders
OL,18,FPolice are calling for protesters to
OL,19,Fdisperse - the march will go ahead when
OL,20,Fthe road is clear, the Orange Order
OL,21,Fsays. A "sterile zone" is in place to
OL,22,Fkeep the two sides apart
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,0,100
