OL,3,ANI first minister asks protesters to
OL,4,Astay until midnight as Orange Order
OL,5,Avows to complete parade
OL,6,
OL,7,FMeanwhile, Social Democratic and Labour
OL,8,FParty leader Claire Hanna says her
OL,9,Fparty is calling for an international
OL,10,Fmediator to help resolve the dispute
OL,12,FIn the 1990s, the Drumcree parade
OL,13,Fsparked some of the most serious
OL,14,Fdisorder in Northern Ireland's history
OL,15,F- how did we get here?
